  "instructions": [
    "In a saucepan, combine water and vegetable dashi extract and bring to a gentle boil.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger, reduce heat and simmer for 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in sliced shiitake mushrooms and cubed tofu, cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add spinach leaves and pomegranate seeds, cook until spinach wilts, about 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in soy sauce and sesame oil, stirring to combine.",
    "Season with salt to taste, simmer for another 3 minutes.",
    "Garnish with toasted sesame seeds before serving.",
    "Serve hot with steamed rice."
